  "lines": [
   "acute kidney injury (AKI) = creatinine ↑ 44 µmol/L, or > 50% over baseline, or clearance ↓ 50%",
   "rule out pre- and post-renal FIRST: the easiest · glomerular filtration rate (GFR) equations are WRONG while creatinine is changing",
   "every patient: urinalysis + renal ultrasound",
   "ANY cause: DIALYSIS NOW for AEIOU = Acidosis, Electrolytes (K ↑), Ingestion of drugs or ischemia, fluid Overload, Uremia"
  ]
